msgstr "将配置添加到 :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` ："

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:71
msgid ""
"``update_period=0.0`` samples every physics step. ``history_length`` stores "
"earlier force samples. Enable optional buffers only when they are needed. "
"Their backend support differs:"
msgstr ""
"``update_period=0.0`` 表示每个物理步都采样。 ``history_length`` "
"用于存储历史力样本。仅在需要时启用可选缓冲区，各后端的支持情况不同："

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:74
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim PhysX supports pose, filtered contact-point, and filtered "
"friction-force tracking, but not aggregate friction-force tracking."
msgstr "Isaac Sim PhysX 支持位姿、过滤后的接触点和摩擦力跟踪，但不支持摩擦合力跟踪。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:76
msgid ""
"OvPhysX supports filtered contact-point and filtered friction-force "
"tracking, but not aggregate friction-force tracking. Pose tracking is "
"supported for a single sensor body per environment."
msgstr "OvPhysX 支持过滤后的接触点和摩擦力跟踪，但不支持摩擦合力跟踪。每个环境只有一个传感器刚体时支持位姿跟踪。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:78
msgid ""
"Newton supports filtered contact-point and aggregate or filtered friction-"
"force tracking, but not pose tracking."
msgstr "Newton 支持过滤后的接触点，以及摩擦合力或过滤后的摩擦力跟踪，但不支持位姿跟踪。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:81
msgid ""
"Filtered contact points and friction-force matrices require filters. Isaac "
"Sim PhysX and OvPhysX require a positive ``max_contact_data_count_per_prim``"
" for these features. Contact-rich scenes may require a larger value. OvPhysX"
" warns and truncates detailed contacts when capacity is exceeded; increase "
"the configured capacity before recreating the sensor to retain all contacts."
msgstr ""
"过滤后的接触点和摩擦力矩阵要求设置过滤条件。Isaac Sim PhysX 和 OvPhysX 还要求 "
"``max_contact_data_count_per_prim`` 为正值。接触较多的场景可能需要更大的值。超过容量时，OvPhysX "
"会发出警告并截断详细接触数据；请在重新创建传感器前增大该容量，以保留全部接触数据。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:86
msgid ""
"Contact positions are averaged over each sensor/filter pair and are ``NaN`` "
"when the pair has no contacts. OvPhysX also resets contact positions to "
"``NaN``. Filtered friction forces sum the pair's friction forces and are "
"zero without contact. On PhysX and OvPhysX, contact points and friction "
"anchors can have different counts."
msgstr ""
"接触位置取各传感器/过滤对象对的平均值；没有接触时为 ``NaN`` 。OvPhysX 在重置时也会将接触位置设为 ``NaN`` "
"。过滤后的摩擦力为该对象对的摩擦力之和，没有接触时为零。在 PhysX 和 OvPhysX 中，接触点与摩擦锚点的数量可能不同。"

