#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:126
msgid ""
"Supported optional buffers are ``None`` unless their matching tracking "
"option or filter is enabled. Normal and friction force histories follow the "
"same shapes with an added ``H`` dimension. Reading aggregate friction on "
"PhysX or OvPhysX raises ``NotImplementedError``. The compatibility alias "
"``friction_forces_w`` returns the aggregate on Newton; on PhysX and OvPhysX "
"it returns ``friction_force_matrix_w`` with a warning. Reading pose data on "
"Newton raises ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr ""
"受支持的可选缓冲区在未启用对应跟踪选项或过滤条件时为 ``None`` 。法向力和摩擦力的历史数据沿用相同形状，但多一个 ``H`` 维度。在 "
"PhysX 或 OvPhysX 上读取摩擦合力会抛出 ``NotImplementedError`` 。兼容别名 "
"``friction_forces_w`` 在 Newton 上返回摩擦合力；在 PhysX 和 OvPhysX 上返回 "
"``friction_force_matrix_w`` 并发出警告。在 Newton 上读取位姿数据会抛出 "
"``NotImplementedError`` 。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:139
msgid ""
"Use ``debug_vis=True`` while validating body expressions and filter "
"partners. The visualization shows sensor contacts but does not change the "
"reported data."
msgstr "验证刚体表达式和过滤对象时，可使用 ``debug_vis=True`` 。可视化会显示传感器接触，但不会改变报告的数据。"

